      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by a \"goblin's weak spot\" or \"goblin's resolve\"? I just need professional advice on the timber quality. Can you just clarify what specific structural defects I should be watching out for in the beam so I don't run into issues later?",
